get.description:
The "whoami" endpoint: verifies the presented API key and echoes its workspace and plan snapshot.

{% hint style="info" %}
Unlike `/v1/compose` (snake_case), this endpoint speaks **camelCase** on the wire: `tierKey`, `generationsRemaining`, and so on.
{% endhint %}

The endpoint is burst-limited per key at your plan's requests-per-minute rate, like compose.

text/event-stream.example:
event: compose.started
data: {"type":"compose.started","generation_id":"gen_2c9a66e1-5dd8-4e0b-9c3d-1a2b3c4d5e6f","model":"frayme-compose"}

event: op
data: {"type":"op","op":"add","path":"/state","value":{}}

event: op
data: {"type":"op","op":"add","path":"/root","value":"card"}

event: op
data: {"type":"op","op":"add","path":"/elements/card","value":{"type":"Card","children":["btn"]}}

event: op
data: {"type":"op","op":"add","path":"/elements/btn","value":{"type":"Button","props":{"label":"Click"}}}

: ping

event: compose.completed
data: {"type":"compose.completed","generation_id":"gen_2c9a66e1-5dd8-4e0b-9c3d-1a2b3c4d5e6f","model":"frayme-compose","operation_count":4,"usage":{"input_tokens":812,"output_tokens":236},"validated":true,"interactions":[],"components_used":["Button","Card"]}
